---
// WorkflowSteps.astro
---

<section class="section workflow-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">SIMPLIFIED WORKFLOW</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Zero setup headaches. Up and running in under 3 minutes.</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        No complicated Kubernetes YAML or heavy agent orchestrators required. Pulse plugs right into your existing git flow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="glass-card step-card">
        <div class="step-badge">STEP 01</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap icon-indigo">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Connect Repository & Policy</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Link your GitHub, GitLab, or Bitbucket repo with one click. Configure custom policy guardrails: define which directories require human sign-off and which can be autonomously merged.
        </p>
        <div class="step-metric">Time required: <strong>45 seconds</strong></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="glass-card step-card">
        <div class="step-badge">STEP 02</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap icon-cyan">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Autonomous AST Synthesis</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Pulse builds a living multi-service dependency matrix. When code updates happen, background agents detect bottlenecks, update deprecated calls, and author 100% typed PRs.
        </p>
        <div class="step-metric">Continuous: <strong>Sub-second checks</strong></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="glass-card step-card">
        <div class="step-badge">STEP 03</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrap icon-emerald">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Verified Canary Rollout</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Deploy changes through automated progressive delivery. Pulse monitors microsecond latency and error spikes. If anything regresses, it rolls back in under 50ms automatically.
        </p>
        <div class="step-metric">Safety: <strong>99.999% Zero Downtime</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .workflow-section {
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .step-icon-wrap {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .icon-indigo { background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); color: #818cf8; }
  .icon-cyan { background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15); color: #22d3ee; }
  .icon-emerald { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #34d399; }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-highlight);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-text {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .step-metric {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .step-metric strong {
    color: var(--brand-emerald);
  }
</style>

